#: src/lib/components/reports/loop-analysis/PredictionAccuracyBody.svelte
msgid "oref gives its unannounced meal (UAM) curve only when glucose increases faster than insulin alone predicts, or when carbs are absorbing. So the report measures UAM accuracy only at these times."
